      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango go ng'wa Mulungu mu sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūlīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'wana wa munhū, galūkaga ūjilolele ī ngūlū ja Isilaeli ūjihangīle, jiwīlage gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Bing'we ngūlū ja Isilaeli, gwigwagi ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba MULUNGU! Ū Seeba MULUNGU alījiwīla ī ngūlū ī nhaale nī ndo, nī myongo nī sī ja ntubīlo, alīhaya: Nalī hihī kūng'wenhela būlūgū, na nakūgakenaagūla a mapandī ging'we a ga higūlya.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myalīlo ying'we īkūkenaagūlwa, nī myalīlo ying'we ya shitambò sha kūzuukīja īkūseesagūlwa; hama a banhū bing'we nakūbabūlagīla kū būtongi wa shiikolile shing'we sha kūlamiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mibimba ya Baisilaeli nakwīlambalaja kū būtongi wa shiikolile shabo sha kūlamiwa; a maguha ging'we nakūgasalang'hanīja mu myalīlo ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī kwene ūko mukwikalaga ī mizengo īkūbiza dalali, a mapandī ga higūlya gakūkambagūlwa; ī myalīlo ying'we īkūkenaagūlwa īlekwe īlī dalali; ī shiikolile shing'we sha kūlamiwa shikūseesagūlwa shibipe, nī myalīlo ying'we ya shitambò sha kūzuukīja īkūkambagūlwa, na shose shose īsho ng'wibeegeja shikūshila ho gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū bingī no ū mu bing'we bakūbūlagwa; hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bamò bing'we nakūbalekeela bikale bapanga, nguno balīho abo bakūpūlūgūka ū mu būlūgū ūlū ng'ūsambaagījiwa kū masī na mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū kū mahanga ūko bakūsaamījiwa abo balasaagīīle bakūnizūkwa ūmo naapīnīhalīlaga kūlwa ng'holò jabo ja būshihani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Būshihani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Būshihani bo Kiimoyo. Mhayo gwa kūlamya shiikolile, nūūlū shikolo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūmo baalī bagalūkīla kū bamulungu bangī, ū nene būnileka; na kūlwa miso gabo ga kwikūmvwa shiikolile shabo sha kūlamiwa. Bakwidalaha no kūlwa būbi ūbo baawīta, nī mihayo yabo ī y'ipelanya pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA; natihayīlile dūhū ī gīkī nakūbenhelela ū nsango gwenūyū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ipaalage makono, ūkiinūje nū gūgūlū gwako hasī; ūhaye, “Makoye!” Nguno yabipaga ī mihayo ū kū banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli, kūlwa būbi na shītīle shabo sha malofu; bakūmalwa līlūshū, nzala na mabūsaatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī kūle akūbūlagwa būsaatu, ūyo alī bbihī akūbūlagwa būlūgū; hama ūyo alapūlūgūke asaage, akūnanulwa nzala. H'ūmo nakūbūmalīla ū būpelanu bone ū kūbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū babo bakūyūchīla kū myalīlo yabo, bayūbabona bachile balambalalile biguulanyaga nī shiikolile shabo sha kūlamiwa, a henaho hū bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. Nguno būlī kwene bakūgwa, ū kū mapandī ga kwigūlya, kū ngūlū jose na jose; mu mbeho ja mitī īfulumile nūūlū mitūndū ya madūūtū mingī. A genayo h'a mapandī ayo baagatūmamīlaga kūfunya shitambò sha kūzuukīja kū shiikolile shabo sha kūlamiwa shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbagoloolela nkono gwane, ī sī yabo nīyīte kūbiza dalali na buyīkī, kwandīja kwitogolo lya kūjīlīīla Dibula; a henaho hūna bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
